DAA4SSMIS initial public release
================================

This repository includes adapted components from UniMatch V2:
https://github.com/LiheYoung/UniMatch-V2
Copyright (c) 2024 Lihe Yang, distributed under the MIT License.

The files under model/backbone/dinov2* are adapted from Meta AI's DINOv2:
https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2
Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates. These files are distributed
under the Apache License 2.0; see third_party_licenses/DINOV2.txt. The attention
implementation was modified to add a CPU fallback.

BCP is implemented from the method described in:
Bidirectional Copy-Paste for Semi-Supervised Medical Image Segmentation,
CVPR 2023.

Release scope: Stage 1, BUSI/ISIC 2D examples, the PROMISE12 3D case-selection
example, and the UniMatch V2 + BCP baseline are public. The paper's MCP / Stage 2
source code is not part of this release. The raw-volume converter is an explicit
reference preprocessing recipe, not a claim of exact historical preprocessing.
